# Files under src/ that no `mod` declaration reaches, as of 2026-08-31.
#
# Each one is compiled into nothing. This file is a ratchet, not an amnesty:
# it exists so `scripts/unreachable_modules.py` can fail on anything NEW while
# these three wait for an owner's decision. Removing a line is the fix;
# adding one needs a reason that survives being read in a year.
#
# A stale entry - a path listed here that no longer exists - also fails the
# check, so this list cannot quietly outlive the files it describes.

# 139 lines of PRODUCT code - operator secret storage on the configured queue
# backend - last touched 2026-07-27. Nothing references it; `secrets::` in
# src/cli/mod.rs resolves to src/cli/secrets.rs, a different module. Either the
# queue secret store is wanted and must be declared, or it is superseded and
# should be deleted.
src/queue/secrets.rs

# Test-support files, unreferenced by anything in src/ or tests/. Integration
# tests under tests/ are their own crate roots and cannot reach a private
# module of the library, so these can only ever have been used through a `mod`
# declaration that is now gone. Delete or re-declare.
src/providers/local/disk_cleanup/kit.rs
src/testutil.rs
